This is a binary companion file for frmReports.frm.
Do not modify manually.

The VBA IDE generates this file automatically when you:
1. Open Excel VBA IDE (Alt+F11)
2. Import frmReports.frm (File -> Import File)
3. The .frx will be auto-created in the same directory

If you see an error about missing .frx, simply:
1. Open frmReports.frm in a text editor
2. Remove the line: Icon = "frmReports.frx":0000
3. Re-import into VBA
